      "schema": "schemas/knowledge-transition.v1.schema.json",
      "stage_count": 20,
      "state_model": "product_of_independent_evidence_axes",
      "axes": [
        "formal",
        "computational",
        "empirical",
        "review",
        "publication",
        "application"
      ],
      "base_k3_semantics_changed": false,
      "notes": [
        "The twenty stages are a research-activity catalogue, not a universal chronology or truth ranking",
        "Proof status is relative to named assumptions and a declared calculus",
        "Empirical support is scoped to a declared population, protocol and uncertainty",
        "Review, publication and application do not automatically change proof status",
        "A finite exhaustive check proves only the declared finite domain",
        "Evidence corrections and invalidations are retained in an auditable history"
      ]
